      "subtitle": "MASAMI's Mekabu Hydrating Conditioner is fortified by the hydrating qualities of the Japanese ocean botanical Mekabu, and enhanced with Laminaria Japonica (Kombu) seaweed, aloe vera, blueberry extract, Vitamin B and other powerful anti-oxidants. This deep yet lightweight conditioner nourishes to restore softness, shine and manageability while soothing the scalp, all without weighing hair down. This conditioner won't leave hair feeling greasy or heavy, just botanically hydrated, smooth and soft.\n\nGreat for every hair type and texture -- and anyone who wants salon hair every day. If your hair is dry, brittle, frizzy or colored, this is for you.\n\nWaves and curls love it too, from 2a to 4c hair.",
